Package: susiR
Title: Standardized Quantification of Phage Lytic Sustainability, Virulence, and Suppression from Microplate Growth-Curve Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tomoyoshi", "Kaneko", email = "kanekotomoyoshi@akane.waseda.jp", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads microplate (OD) growth-curve time-course data together with a
    user-supplied sample-mapping table and automatically computes four
    complementary phage-efficacy indices: the Sustainability Index (SusI),
    Virulence Index (VI; Storms et al. 2020), Suppression Index (SupI; Kim
    et al. 2024), and the ti/tc time ratio. Experimental structure (condition
    labels, number of conditions, number and layout of biological replicates)
    is inferred automatically from the mapping table rather than hard-coded,
    so a single, unmodified analysis pipeline works across arbitrary plate
    layouts and experimental designs.
